User.description:
Serialized User document. The toJSON method removes password.

Field definitions:

```javascript
{
  _id: {
    type: String,
    required: true,
    pattern: "^[a-fA-F0-9]{24}$",
  },
  email: {
    type: String,
    required: true,
    trim: true,
  },
  username: {
    type: String,
    required: true,
    trim: true,
  },
  avatar: {
    type: String,
    required: true,
    default: "https://ac.goit.global/fullstack/react/default-avatar.jpg",
  },
  createdAt: {
    type: String,
    required: true,
    format: "date-time",
  },
  updatedAt: {
    type: String,
    required: true,
    format: "date-time",
  },
  __v: {
    type: Number,
    required: true,
  },
}
```

